  revision     the round-record event (the CHANGELOG entry body via --reason) — singleton per seat-round; emit AFTER your report edits land
  show         read a projection on STDOUT (the tool is the read path; the .md files are for human verification): --view board|findings|worklist|friction|ledger|archive|debate|changelog|changes|citation-ledger|lines-of-inquiry|telemetry

